English frontend and fallback conversion behavior adapt hexgrad/Misaki
(Apache-2.0). Tokenizer/POS behavior adapts spaCy and Thinc (MIT).
MurmurHash algorithms are public domain, authored by Austin Appleby.
Embedded data and models:
- data/*_gold.json, data/*_silver.json: hexgrad/Misaki dictionaries (Apache-2.0), unchanged.
- data/tokenizer.json, models/pos.*: derived from spaCy en_core_web_sm 3.8.0 (MIT),
  converted to JSON and ONNX.
- fallback/neural/models/*: PeterReid/graphemes_to_phonemes_en_us and _en_gb
  (Apache-2.0), modified: split into encoder/decoder and converted to ONNX.
  See fallback/neural/models/README.md.
